<title>USA: Smith Barney investment banker leaves - WSJ.</title>
<headline>Smith Barney investment banker leaves - WSJ.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investment banker Sean Crowley, the head of the media and telecommunications group at Smith Barney Inc, has left to join Merrill Lynch &amp; Co as managing director in high-yield finance, the Wall Street Journal said.</p>
<p>The Journal in Monday's electronic edition said Crowley was previously head of Smith Barney's high-yield business before being named to lead its media group in February.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
